# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Letter to Jin'Zil (1060), Sample for Helbrim (1358, from Zinge in the Undercity).
# Left out: The Harvester (897).
# Trial at the Field of Giants (1824, Warriors) runs for 30 minutes: it is taken from Ruga on Jorn's stop after the thunder
# lizards, right before the thunderhawks, the eggs and the antennae, not on the first Camp Taurajo stop.

# Horde 12-30 in the order the quest levels fit (2026-11-07): the Barrens come after Silverpine
# Forest, as one stay at 15-21 with the low Stonetalon road (the Webwinder Path and Windshear
# Crag). This guide is the former Barrens 12-16 and the first half of the former Barrens 19-23 in
# one: the Crossroads, Ratchet and the Southsea beach, the oases, the Dry Hills and the Sludge
# Fen, Northwatch Hold, Vrang and Walton, Verog, Camp Taurajo and the Bristlebacks, the Orgrimmar
# trip at 20, Jorn's hunt, Hezrul and Counterattack!, then Seereth's road into Stonetalon. The
# Barrens' level 22-27 quests (Gann Stonespire, Blackthorn Ridge, Betrayal from Within, Weapons of
# Choice) come back with Stonetalon's upper half at 24-26 in
# forever/horde/04-the-barrens, after Ashenvale and Hillsbrad.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar -> Far Watch Post (Orcs and Trolls: Kargal, Uzzek) -> the Crossroads (flight
# path, bind) -> the Razormane camp -> the Crossroads -> Ratchet (Southsea beach) -> the oases and
# Regthar -> the Dry Hills -> the Sludge Fen console -> the Razormane camp -> the Crossroads ->
# the Stagnant and Lushwater oases -> the Dry Hills -> Echeyakee -> the Crossroads -> Ratchet
# (Samophlange handed in): the Raptor Grounds' nests and the silver -> Gazlowe's Stolen Booty on
# the beach -> Northwatch Hold and Gilthares' escort back to Ratchet -> fly to the Crossroads ->
# the Dry Hills (Vrang, Walton) -> Wenikee -> the Sludge Fen shredder
# and Nugget Slugs -> the Boulder Lode Mine -> Wenikee -> the Crossroads -> Verog -> Camp Taurajo (flight path) -> the Bristleback camps ->
# Agama'gor -> fly to Orgrimmar for level 20 training -> fly to Ratchet -> Ishamuhale -> the
# Crossroads, Regthar,
# Hezrul -> Camp Taurajo (bind): Jorn's thunder lizards and thunderhawks -> the Crossroads:
# Counterattack! -> west to Seereth, Makaba and Malaka'jin -> the Webwinder Path, Ziz Fizziks and
# Windshear Crag -> back down to Seereth. The next guide goes north to the Mor'shan Rampart and
# Ashenvale.
#
# Orcs and Trolls: Far Watch Post first (Crossroads Conscription from Kargal: they handed him
# Conscript of the Horde at the end of their Durotar guide, so it is not carried through Silverpine;
# Warriors hand Path of Defense to Uzzek), then their own Crossroads step (Meats to Orgrimmar to Devrak; Ride to Orgrimmar
# is left out, as Gryshka would take it at 20, five levels late, and they have the city's flight
# path from the Silverpine guide). Warriors finish
# Thun'grim Firegaze / Forged Steel (1502, 1503) by the Razormane camp; Shamans finish Call of Fire
# (1525-1527): the Fire Tar from the Razormane, Telf Joolam's brazier across the river and Kranal
# Fiss. Tauren Shamans and Warriors do their Call of Fire and Path of Defense steps from the
# Crossroads.
#
# Background goals: the Raptor Heads and Plainstrider Beaks are collected on the way (#1135), each
# with a finish step before its hand-in.
#
# Group quests: WANTED: Bruuz (92706, `when group 92706`, #639) and Gerenzo's Orders (1090, `when group 1090`,
# #1370: Piznik's five-minute defence in the Windshear Mine, quest level 22, lost solo at 23 and 25 in players'
# recordings). Owatanka (884), Lakota'mani (883)
# and the Rogue's Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2478, Gallywix is elite) are optional.
#
# Dropped: Chen's Empty Keg part 2 and 3 (821, 822): part 2's tusks, kidneys and horn are drops
# spread over three areas of this guide, walked through and come back for. Deepmoss Spider Eggs
# (1069): few recorded players hand it in.
#
# Carried on, finished: Report to Kadrak (6541, the next guide's first stop) and The Ashenvale Hunt
# (6382, Night Run). Further Instructions (1094) is left out: Ziz offers it at 21, and Sputtervalve
# in Ratchet is next passed at 25, for one hand-in on a stop of its own.
#
# Class quests: Warriors take Speak with Ruga / Trial at the Field of Giants / Speak with Thun'grim
# (1823-1825) on the Orgrimmar trip at 20 and gather the Twitching Antennae at the Field of Giants
# after Jorn's thunderhawks; they vanish 15 minutes after they drop (ItemSparse 7119, 900 s), so
# Ruga at Camp Taurajo takes them at once. Shamans: Call of Water 1528 (Orgrimmar), 1530 (Islen
# by Ratchet), 1535 at Brine south of Camp Taurajo; 1536 waits at the Spring Well beside Tarren
# Mill. Warlocks: the succubus chain (1507-1513), The Binding on the Orgrimmar stop of the next
# guide. Troll Priests Shadowguard (5680, Ur'kyo); Undead Priests Dark Sacrifice (5646, Ur'kyo to
# Aelthalyste in the Undercity on the Hillsbrad guide's stop). Rogues The Shattered Salute / Deep
# Cover / Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2460, 2458, 2478 optional). Tauren Druids: Trial of
# the Lake at 16 and Cure Poison (6126-6130), Cat Form at 20 (98340-98362; 98341 for Skyborne).
# Trial of the Sea Lion (30) is taken at 16 and carried: the Sludge Fen's half pendant on this
# guide's walk north, the Silverpine half on the ride to Hillsbrad at 21 (its lockbox gives it only
# while the quest is in the log, #1386), the pendant joined and handed in from the Undercity at the
# end of forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills, as Aquatic Form (31) at Turak.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar at 20 for everyone but Druids and Paladins; Druids in Thunder Bluff at
# 16 and 20; Paladins in Thunder Bluff at about 21.

