  zone The Barrens
  tip South-east on the way back to the Crossroads: Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp.
  tip Careful: Savannah Huntresses roam around the lair. They respawn quickly and often join the fight alongside Echeyakee, so clear them out before you blow the horn.
  tip Sunscale raptors here count toward the heads.
