# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South-west: the Raptor Grounds, then Northwatch Hold
step Raptor nests
  tip South-west from Ratchet across the plains to the Raptor Grounds: the three nests sit together south-west of the oasis, and Sunscale Scytheclaws guard them.
  interact 6907 quest 905.1
  interact 6908 quest 905.2
  interact 6906 quest 905.3

step Raptor Grounds: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Barrens
  tip Sunscale Scytheclaws hunt the plains around the Raptor Grounds; they drop the horns. Mebok takes them when the escort brings you back to Ratchet.
  tip South-east toward the coast: the stolen silver lies in a raptor nest north-west of Northwatch Hold.
  collect 5055 quest 865.1
  collect 5061 quest 3281.1

step Stolen Booty
  tip East to the beach, at the south end of the pirate camp: the crate of boots and the fragile crate with the lens sit there, a short walk north of Northwatch Hold.
  collect 5076 quest 888.1 @62.6,49.6
  collect 5077 quest 888.2 @63.6,49.3

step Northwatch Hold: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Barrens
  tip Northwatch Hold, on the coast just south of the pirate camp. The Theramore Marines and Preservers (15-16) drop the medals; Captain Fairmount (20) and the two cannoneers (19) stand in the keep and on its walls, and they are why the hold waits until now.
  tip Careful: Each named target is linked to a healer and guards, and Fairmount has three extra marines with her. Killing the healer first makes the fight easier.
  collect 5078 quest 891.4
  kill 3393 quest 891.1               -- On the top floor
  kill 3455 quest 891.2               -- On the top floor
  kill 3454 quest 891.3               -- Upstairs

step Free From the Hold
  tip Gilthares Firebough is chained inside the hold. Talk to him to start the escort and stay close: Theramore soldiers attack on the way out. He walks you back to Ratchet.
  accept 898                          -- Inside

step Ratchet
  goto 62.3,39.1
  complete 898

step Ratchet
  turnin 898                          -- Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun
  turnin 891

step Ratchet
  when complete 865
  turnin 865                          -- Mebok Mizzyrix, beside the WANTED poster

step Ratchet
  turnin 888                          -- Gazlowe, upstairs

step Fly to Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"

step The Crossroads
  turnin 905                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 3261                         -- Sergra Darkthorn
  turnin 3281                         -- Gazrog

step Dreadmist Peak
  only Tauren,Druid
  tip Head north from the Crossroads to Dreadmist Peak and fill the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler at the Dreadmist Peak Pool, then back to Tonga Runetotem in the Crossroads. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi beside him sells Earthroot, three at a time until he restocks.
  collect 15843 quest 6127.1 @48.4,18.9 only Tauren -- Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler
  turnin 6127 only Tauren -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6128 only Tauren
  buy 2449 x5 npc 3490 optional       -- Earthroot from Hula'mahi; herbalists pick it on the plains

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-west: the Dry Hills

step Kolkar camp
  only Tauren,Druid
  tip Lost Barrens Kodos roam the plains around the Kolkar camp north-west of Regthar; herbalists pick Earthroot there too.
  collect 15852 x5 quest 6128.2       -- Kodo Horn
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6128.1        -- Earthroot

step Vrang Wildgore
  zone The Barrens
  tip North to the Dry Hills. Vrang Wildgore camps below the hills; Walton, the hermit on the ridge behind him, has work for you only once Vrang sends you up.
  accept 95494                        -- Vrang Wildgore
  accept 95507

step The Barrens: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Barrens
  tip Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of the hills, and the Sprung Traps lie among them. Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the hills to the west.
  tip Careful: The route in passes stealthed Harpy Ambushers and an elite harpy that patrols.
  collect 269719 quest 95507.1
  collect 269715 quest 95494.1 @45.0,14.5
  collect 5055 quest 865.1 @44.7,14.3 -- Raptor Horns, if still open: Sunscale Scytheclaws prowl among the lions
  collect 5067 quest 876.1

step Vrang Wildgore
  turnin 95494                        -- Vrang Wildgore
  turnin 95507
  accept 95495

step Walton
  turnin 95495                        -- Walton
  accept 95621

step Trouble in the Valley
  tip Corporal Adamore and his marines hold the wrecked caravan south of Walton. The marines are linked: pulling one calls the rest. Pull from the edge and run; they leash short, so you can thin the camp one at a time before tackling the Corporal.
  collect 270151 quest 95621.1 @41.8,15.6

step Walton
  turnin 95621                        -- Walton
  accept 95508
  complete 95508                      -- Assist Walton: stay by him when Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines come up the ridge
  turnin 95508

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  zone The Barrens
  tip East from Walton toward the Sludge Fen: Wenikee stands at the camp on the road north of the Crossroads.
  turnin 3921
  accept 3922

step Ignition
  tip Wizzlecrank's Shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp in the Sludge Fen; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key.
  accept 858                          -- Wizzlecrank's Shredder
  collect 5050 quest 858.1 @56.3,8.6 map 1413
  turnin 858
  accept 863

step Strange Lockbox
  only Tauren,Druid
  when onquest 30
  tip The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility for Trial of the Sea Lion.
  collect 15883

step The Escape
  tip Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet.
  tip Careful: The route leads west and climbs a ramp. Once you reach the top, two Venture Company mobs ambush you.
  goto 55.4,7.7
  complete 863

step Nugget Slugs
  tip The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen.
  collect 11143 quest 3922.1

step Boulder Lode Mine
  tip The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald.
  collect 5097 quest 896.1

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  zone The Barrens
  tip West from the mine to Wenikee's camp, then south down the road to the Crossroads.
  turnin 3922
  accept 3923                         -- Keep it: Rilli Greasygob is in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, on the Orgrimmar trip at 20

step the Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip South down the road to the Crossroads: Darsok stands on the tower platform, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate.
  turnin 876                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger
