step Verog the Dervish
  zone The Barrens
  tip Verog walks among the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads.
  collect 5023 quest 851.1
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1 "Cure Sickly Gazelle" only Tauren,Druid -- Sickly Gazelle: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam the plains all around the Crossroads

step Bristleback camps
  tip The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Mankrik's wife lies at their north edge, on your way south. Leave the quilboar for now: Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo wants the same camps cleared. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest.
  talk 10668 quest 4921.1 @49.3,50.3

step Camp Taurajo
  tip Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo.
  accept 878                          -- Mangletooth, in the cage
  getfp "Camp Taurajo" npc 10378      -- Omusa Thunderhorn
  turnin 3261                         -- Jorn Skyseer
  accept 882

step Bramblescar
  tip Back north into the Bristleback camps. Any Bristleback can drop a tusk for Mankrik, so collect them while you kill these for Mangletooth. Keep one Blood Shard.
  kill 3260 quest 878.1
  kill 3261 quest 878.2
  kill 3263 quest 878.3
  collect 5085 quest 899.1

step Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 878                          -- Mangletooth
  accept 5052

