step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip North up the Gold Road to the Crossroads: Mankrik stands by the inn, Korran west of the north gate. Keep the Blood Shard: Mangletooth takes it on the next stop in Camp Taurajo.
  turnin 899                          -- Mankrik
  turnin 4921
  accept 95774                        -- Mankrik offers Her Name Is Olgra once Lost in Battle is handed in
  accept 868                          -- Korran: the eggs are in the Field of Giants, south of Camp Taurajo, after the Orgrimmar trip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar at 20

step Fly to Orgrimmar
