# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: Verog, Camp Taurajo, the Bristlebacks

step Regthar Deathgate
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 851
  accept 852

step Hezrul Bloodmark
  tip Hezrul leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis, south of Regthar. He walks that shore, from about 46,36 in the north to 46,42 in the south: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the shore until you meet him. Hand his head to Regthar on your last Crossroads stop.
  collect 5025 quest 852.1 @46.0,41.1

step Olgra's Adornments
  tip On the way back down the Gold Road to Camp Taurajo: the Razormane Raiders among the Bristleback camps, either side of the road north of the camp, carry Olgra's Adornments. Hand them to Mankrik on your last Crossroads stop.
  collect 277277 quest 95774.1

