step Jorn Skyseer
  tip Warriors: take Trial at the Field of Giants from Ruga Ragetotem now, not earlier: it runs for 30 minutes from the accept. The thunderhawks and the eggs come first, the antennae last, then straight back to Ruga.
  turnin 907
  accept 913
  turnin 884 optional
