step Piznik
  when group 1090
  tip Piznik's defence is hard alone at this level: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone.
  tip Piznik mines at the bottom of the Windshear Mine on the east side of the crag, past its kobolds (levels 19-23). Talk to him, then keep him alive for five minutes while he mines: a dozen or more kobolds come at him in waves, melee fighters first, then casters, and the mine's own kobolds respawn into the fight. If he dies, the quest fails.
  accept 1090                         -- Piznik, below ground
  complete 1090
